conditions": ["Findings characterize only the pinned atlas snapshots (theory atlas sha256:f712ea4e9c6b9137fa180ad91e73a86d8d09862792f33174c77acd76a891e610, 87 entries; works atlas sha256:9d14e877efb245cc04b8451734b26285a274dda0418f5131db257d2e4312d373, 214 entries), not the full population of AI-self-consumption artworks or model-collapse literature beyond what each atlas has catalogued.", "Findings do not extend to works or papers outside the deterministic candidate sets fixed before classification (works-atlas cluster-7 membership; theory-atlas model-collapse keyword match).", "Findings about individual works are bounded by what each atlas's own decisive_move/summary field discloses about that work's production process; an atlas record silent on training provenance cannot license a stronger claim than the record supports."]}
